// Title: PUA - CleanWipe Execution
// Rule ID: f44800ac-38ec-471f-936e-3fa7d9c53100
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
